OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CToday:FA cold start across the region  
OL,6,Fwith the odd patch of freezing mist    
OL,7,Fand fog which is likely to linger. A   
OL,8,Ffine, dry but cold day follows with    
OL,9,Ftemperatures struggling away from the  
OL,10,Fcoast, despite the sunshine. Light     
OL,11,Fwinds.                                 
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy cloud develops through 
OL,14,Fthe evening, with an isolated shower   
OL,15,Fmoving into the coast and the          
OL,16,FCheviots. Turning cold where skies     
OL,17,Fremain clear. Becoming breezy along    
OL,18,Fthe coast and hills.                   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
