OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CSunday:FA partly cloudy day with the   
OL,6,Fodd shower possible, mainly on the     
OL,7,Fcoasts. Remaining cold inland and      
OL,8,Fbreezier than Saturday.                
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FPartly
OL,11,Fcloudy with isolated showers on        
OL,12,FMonday. Turning cloudier through       
OL,13,FTuesday with strengthening winds and   
OL,14,Frain arriving later. Cloudy and breezy 
OL,15,Fon Wednesday. Temperatures slowly      
OL,16,Frecovering through the period.         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
